=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Rotih Moalghett} at (I-8) in {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)} (Map 2) for a storytelling sequence.
* Travel to {z:Castle Oztroja (S)} and zone in for a storytelling sequence.
* Return to {n:Rotih Moalghett} for another storytelling sequence.
** Afterwards you will receive the {@k}{k:Fort Key|Fort key}. You may return to {n:Rotih Moalghett} to obtain an additional {@k}{k:Fort Key|Fort key} in the event you lose the upcoming battle.
* Examine the **Colorful Door** at (H-5) in {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)} (Map 2). This will begin a BCNM in which you must face waves of Yagudo soldiers.
** When zoning into the BCNM, all buffs will be removed.
** Trusts can be summoned.
** Enemy Yagudo have very low HP, making them highly vulnerable to AoE magic and weapon skills.
*** As such, any job with strong AoE capability (BLU, BLM, SCH, etc.) is a good pick for this fight.
** {n:Valaineral} also works well here due to all the mobs using you as their enmity target.
** Generally the final mob should be {m:Laa Yaku the Austere}.
* After the Yagudo are all defeated you will be teleported to {z:West Sarutabaruta (S)}, zone into {z:Windurst Waters (S)} for the final storytelling sequence and your reward.

----
If you are working on {p:Wings of the Goddess} missions then return to {p:Cait Sith (Mission)}.
